    <string name="tutorial_subtitle">FOUR STEPS TO A CLEAN LIFT</string>
    <string name="step_label">STEP %1$d OF %2$d</string>
    <string name="tutorial_title_1">THE TORCH SWEEP</string>
    <string name="tutorial_body_1">Every room opens with a short torch sweep that shows all sixteen plates. Memorise where the stones are before the velvet falls back.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_title_2">THE CLUE</string>
    <string name="tutorial_body_2">The brass card names one stone. Find all three plates hiding it, then a second clue takes its place.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_title_3">SUSPICION AND CHALK</string>
    <string name="tutorial_body_3">A wrong plate flips back, costs one suspicion pip and leaves a chalk mark you can read. Three pips end the case.</string>
    <string name="tutorial_title_4">CHAIN AND LOCKPICK</string>
    <string name="tutorial_body_4">Three matches in a row grant a lockpick that opens a correct plate for free, but the chain resets to zero.</string>

